u \i[o]\![anim,clear,ch]didn\i[ch]\![anim,clear,o]'t kn\i[o]\![anim,clear,ch]ow at \i[ch]\![anim,clear,o]least \i[base]\![anim,clear,ch]a bit\s[161]\i[a] of that\i[ch]\![anim,clear,a] alr\i[a]\![anim,clear,ch]eady.\i[ch]\![anim,clear,a]..\e"
